# Image Assets Folder

Store your images here for the WoodWise project.

## Recommended Images:
- hero-wood.jpg (1200x800px) - Main hero section
- ai-scan.jpg (600x400px) - AI scanning feature
- restoration.jpg (600x400px) - Wood restoration
- calendar.jpg (600x400px) - Maintenance calendar
- about-us.jpg (600x400px) - About section image

## Usage:
Reference images in your components using:
`/assets/images/your-image.jpg`
